{"logId": "33804dad-dbda-4941-be0e-06c82776e97f", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "心中有爱、温暖前行", "block_bbox": [239, 226, 714, 284], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 226.0], [714.0, 226.0], [714.0, 284.0], [239.0, 284.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：胖东来百货", "block_bbox": [581, 293, 714, 315], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[581.0, 293.0], [713.0, 293.0], [713.0, 314.0], [581.0, 314.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [75, 601, 224, 727], "block_id": 2, "block_order": null, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[75.0, 601.0], [224.0, 601.0], [224.0, 727.0], [75.0, 727.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "当寒风吹动落叶而雪的消息从北方传来，当新年的熹微曙光笼罩大地之时，新乡胖东来全体员工刚刚经历了跨年夜沸腾的十二个小时；当播音室的新年倒计时响起，我们还正在满头汗水的为顾客递拿商品；当新年的鞭炮声响起，我们还正在紧张，快速地收款、送券；当新的一年悄悄来到我们身边的时候，我们还正在有序地疏导数以万计的顾客，保障现场的安全……。我们用辛勤的汗水，用刷新三年来历史新高的骄人业绩，用这种独特的方式，与现场数万名我们最心爱的顾客一起迎来了2009年。", "block_bbox": [238, 393, 1015, 551], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 393.0], [1015.0, 393.0], [1015.0, 551.0], [238.0, 551.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "回望2008，我们依然难掩心中的激动，这是不平常的一年。汶川地震曾震裂我们所有中华儿女的心，胖东来人在第一时间冲到了抗震救灾的前线，我们不仅捐款捐物，还亲手从倒塌的废墟中拯救生命：举国欢腾的北京奥运会，我们没有亲临现场，但依然体会到了壮美场景给我们带来的震撼和欣喜；在我们全心融入整个国家悲与喜的一年，我们新乡胖东来也收获了很多，成熟了很多，我们的卖场环境和服务水平有了明显的提升，我们新引进的品牌和商品种类也更能满足顾客的需求。回首过去的一年我们很充实：回首过去的一年，我们的心中被爱填满：在新年到来的时刻，我们更多的是——感恩。", "block_bbox": [237, 558, 1016, 749], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 558.0], [1016.0, 558.0], [1016.0, 749.0], [237.0, 749.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们首先感谢的是我们的顾客，因为做为商业，顾客是我们的衣食父母，我们所收获的一切都是顾客给的，正是得到了新乡父老乡亲——我们最尊贵的顾客的支持和帮助，我们才有了今天的一切。", "block_bbox": [238, 756, 1014, 816], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 756.0], [1014.0, 756.0], [1014.0, 816.0], [238.0, 816.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们其次感谢的是我们合作的厂家，是他们为新乡胖东来带来了更多更好的品牌，正是有了他们的大力支持，我们的商品品位才得到更好的提升，我们才能更好的满足顾客全方位的需求。", "block_bbox": [238, 823, 1015, 882], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 823.0], [1015.0, 823.0], [1015.0, 882.0], [238.0, 882.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们还要感谢的是我们所有员工的家属，正是他们无私的奉献和支持，正是他们默默的付出，正是他们体贴的照顾，我们才能把全部精力投入到工作中，才能把我们的笑脸传递给顾客。\n最后我们还要感谢我们自己，感谢我们身边的同伴，这一年我们很努力，这一年，我们付出了我们的智慧和汗水，我们对自己说：2008，我无悔！\n面对2009年，我们激情澎湃，本着“公平、自由、快乐、博爱”的信仰，我们快乐出发：只要心中有爱，2009，温暖前行！\n最后祝福天下所有的人：新年快乐，身体健康，合家幸福！", "block_bbox": [238, 889, 1015, 949], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 889.0], [1015.0, 889.0], [1015.0, 949.0], [238.0, 949.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 956, 654, 1048], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 956.0], [654.0, 956.0], [654.0, 1048.0], [239.0, 1048.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 1056, 622, 1147], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1056.0], [622.0, 1056.0], [622.0, 1147.0], [239.0, 1147.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [240, 1154, 604, 1215], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 1154.0], [604.0, 1154.0], [604.0, 1215.0], [240.0, 1215.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [606, 959, 1129, 1370], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[606.0, 959.0], [1129.0, 959.0], [1129.0, 1370.0], [606.0, 1370.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer", "block_content": "真情是一种号召力", "block_bbox": [110, 1406, 401, 1449], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 1406.0], [401.0, 1406.0], [401.0, 1449.0], [110.0, 1449.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.8705924153327942, "coordinate": [239, 226, 714, 284], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 226.0], [714.0, 226.0], [714.0, 284.0], [239.0, 284.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7606176137924194, "coordinate": [581, 293, 714, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[581.0, 293.0], [713.0, 293.0], [713.0, 314.0], [581.0, 314.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.33779874444007874, "coordinate": [75, 601, 224, 727], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[75.0, 601.0], [224.0, 601.0], [224.0, 727.0], [75.0, 727.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9474000930786133, "coordinate": [238, 393, 1015, 551], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 393.0], [1015.0, 393.0], [1015.0, 551.0], [238.0, 551.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9407658576965332, "coordinate": [237, 558, 1016, 749], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 558.0], [1016.0, 558.0], [1016.0, 749.0], [237.0, 749.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8978351950645447, "coordinate": [238, 756, 1014, 816], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 756.0], [1014.0, 756.0], [1014.0, 816.0], [238.0, 816.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8994660377502441, "coordinate": [238, 823, 1015, 882], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 823.0], [1015.0, 823.0], [1015.0, 882.0], [238.0, 882.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9033047556877136, "coordinate": [238, 889, 1015, 949], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 889.0], [1015.0, 889.0], [1015.0, 949.0], [238.0, 949.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.837923526763916, "coordinate": [239, 956, 654, 1048], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 956.0], [654.0, 956.0], [654.0, 1048.0], [239.0, 1048.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8834909796714783, "coordinate": [239, 1056, 622, 1147], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 1056.0], [622.0, 1056.0], [622.0, 1147.0], [239.0, 1147.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.829863429069519, "coordinate": [240, 1154, 604, 1215], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 1154.0], [604.0, 1154.0], [604.0, 1215.0], [240.0, 1215.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.8909363150596619, "coordinate": [606, 959, 1129, 1370], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[606.0, 959.0], [1129.0, 959.0], [1129.0, 1370.0], [606.0, 1370.0]]}, {"cls_id": 8, "label": "footer", "score": 0.6205987930297852, "coordinate": [110, 1406, 401, 1449], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[110.0, 1406.0], [401.0, 1406.0], [401.0, 1449.0], [110.0, 1449.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 心中有爱、温暖前行\n\n作者：胖东来百货\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_75_601_224_727.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n当寒风吹动落叶而雪的消息从北方传来，当新年的熹微曙光笼罩大地之时，新乡胖东来全体员工刚刚经历了跨年夜沸腾的十二个小时；当播音室的新年倒计时响起，我们还正在满头汗水的为顾客递拿商品；当新年的鞭炮声响起，我们还正在紧张，快速地收款、送券；当新的一年悄悄来到我们身边的时候，我们还正在有序地疏导数以万计的顾客，保障现场的安全……。我们用辛勤的汗水，用刷新三年来历史新高的骄人业绩，用这种独特的方式，与现场数万名我们最心爱的顾客一起迎来了2009年。\n\n回望2008，我们依然难掩心中的激动，这是不平常的一年。汶川地震曾震裂我们所有中华儿女的心，胖东来人在第一时间冲到了抗震救灾的前线，我们不仅捐款捐物，还亲手从倒塌的废墟中拯救生命：举国欢腾的北京奥运会，我们没有亲临现场，但依然体会到了壮美场景给我们带来的震撼和欣喜；在我们全心融入整个国家悲与喜的一年，我们新乡胖东来也收获了很多，成熟了很多，我们的卖场环境和服务水平有了明显的提升，我们新引进的品牌和商品种类也更能满足顾客的需求。回首过去的一年我们很充实：回首过去的一年，我们的心中被爱填满：在新年到来的时刻，我们更多的是——感恩。\n\n我们首先感谢的是我们的顾客，因为做为商业，顾客是我们的衣食父母，我们所收获的一切都是顾客给的，正是得到了新乡父老乡亲——我们最尊贵的顾客的支持和帮助，我们才有了今天的一切。\n\n我们其次感谢的是我们合作的厂家，是他们为新乡胖东来带来了更多更好的品牌，正是有了他们的大力支持，我们的商品品位才得到更好的提升，我们才能更好的满足顾客全方位的需求。\n\n我们还要感谢的是我们所有员工的家属，正是他们无私的奉献和支持，正是他们默默的付出，正是他们体贴的照顾，我们才能把全部精力投入到工作中，才能把我们的笑脸传递给顾客。\n\n最后我们还要感谢我们自己，感谢我们身边的同伴，这一年我们很努力，这一年，我们付出了我们的智慧和汗水，我们对自己说：2008，我无悔！\n\n面对2009年，我们激情澎湃，本着“公平、自由、快乐、博爱”的信仰，我们快乐出发：只要心中有爱，2009，温暖前行！\n\n最后祝福天下所有的人：新年快乐，身体健康，合家幸福！\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_606_959_1129_1370.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"43%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_75_601_224_727.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//33804dad-dbda-4941-be0e-06c82776e97f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_75_601_224_727.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A03%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2Fbfacd8ec25a14e5b33d8a36b7f4a24202b530fa06c7e0cfdc59e01c169dad92b", "imgs/img_in_image_box_606_959_1129_1370.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//33804dad-dbda-4941-be0e-06c82776e97f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_606_959_1129_1370.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A03%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2F0e87d95974fec7becec849878bde5681f600207c81393fb98ed827715ea1283b"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//33804dad-dbda-4941-be0e-06c82776e97f/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A03%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2F8eecb35aa6ec2410e89164fb68bab7030ef894b4ed3d9867fdb7a687976c0b3d"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//33804dad-dbda-4941-be0e-06c82776e97f/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A03%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2F54d27b12e02de068f182408a3fb9cc7c169482b84522b1fdaff4334b2e046512"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//33804dad-dbda-4941-be0e-06c82776e97f/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A03%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff61cac9044552d1dfd1a222ef29151cc3884752ffeea415c5f6619ec5b45cb42"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
